<!--
  One glyph for both states, used by the home-screen widget's button.

  The widget redraws only when its own buttons are pressed, so a play triangle could
  sit there lying while the music was playing; a symbol that means "play or pause"
  is always true. The driving floating window used to share it, but its buttons can
  be replaced while it is open, so it shows a real Play or Pause instead
  (ic_driving_play / ic_driving_pause).
-->
